<title>USA: MMI Cos Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>MMI Cos Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Dil shr		    $0.09		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			  1,080		    6,741</p>
<p> Revs			62,747		   59,261</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,975		   10,028</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include loss of $5.1 million, or $0.43 a share, from discontinued operations and net realized investment gains of $146,000, or $0.01 a share. 1995 quarter includes net realized gains of $863,000, or $0.05 a share.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Dil shr		    $1.95		    $2.34</p>
<p> Net			 21,015		   22,695</p>
<p> Revs		     243,178		  218,744</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	10,770		    9,683</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full year 1996 results include $5.1 million, or $0.47 a share loss from discontinued operations and $40,000, or $0.01 a share realized investment loss. Full 1995 includes $1.4 million, or $0.09 a share realized investment gain.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
